# Task 1 (16h from Mon 08:00) finishes Tue 17:00, and a zero-lag FS milestone
# sits at its predecessor's finish instant, so Task 3 is on day 1 (Tue), not on
# the next working start (Wed). Project agrees: corpus/mspdi/18-milestone-after-fs.xml
# "A" -> "Sign-off" is this shape (see fs_milestone_instant in projcore, #59).
# bar_1 pins the scale: the milestone is on its predecessor's finish day.
test gantt milestone is a diamond
  open ../fixtures/gantt-milestone.xml
  assert bar_1 is critical 0-1
  assert bar_3 is milestone 1-1
  shot bar:3
  shot gantt
